module github.com/SpareCores/sc-karpenter-nodepool/test/l4

go 1.26.6

// L4 (docs/plans/v1/wip/00-overview.md §8.4) in a module of its own, so the
// providers' dependency trees never enter the controller's go.mod. Provider
// versions are the released tags of the lines the overview (§5.2) pins:
// aws v1.14.1 (tag commit bde00654; the overview pins 30c236ca, a later
// commit) and azure v1.14.3 (tag commit 07151c55; the overview pins 8878fa43,
// a later commit). Both build together against core v1.14.1 and the
// Kubernetes libraries of the main module.

